     <P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 7.5pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-outline-level: 2" align=center><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=微软雅黑><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020091013592901.jpg" target=_blank> </A><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020091013580521.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020091013580521.jpg" width=1200 height=800> </A></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=p style="BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0pt auto 15pt; TEXT-INDENT: 27.75pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>在第</FONT>36个教师节来临之际，9月9日</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>下午</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>，市教育局党委副书记、副局长马成永</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>在市教育局高教处处长赵佳维陪同下，</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>来校慰问</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>他结对联系的高层次人才</FONT>——赵贤祥、徐雪梅、杨云焱等三位特级教师</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>校党委书记、校长王琛陪同慰问。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=p style="BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0pt auto 15pt; TEXT-INDENT: 27.75pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020091013585371.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020091013585363.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020091013585341.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020091013585380.jpg"><BR><BR></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=p style="BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0pt auto 15pt; TEXT-INDENT: 27.75pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>在</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>图书馆教工书吧，</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>马成永向三位名师一一献上鲜花，并与他们亲切座谈</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>他首先</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>感谢三位</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>名</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>师对绍兴教育的倾情付出</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>，尤其是</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>两位省外名师</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>远离家乡、克服困难，</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>加盟绍兴一中</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>继续</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>教育奋斗，情怀令人感佩。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=p style="BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0pt auto 15pt; TEXT-INDENT: 27.75pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020091013591280.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020091013591280.jpg" width=1200 height=800> </A></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=p style="BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0pt auto 15pt; TEXT-INDENT: 27.75pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>在座谈中，马成永认真听取了名师们的所思所感、想法建议。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>三位名师</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>都是新进</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>一中，表示</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>真切地</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>感受到了</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>学校</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>的热情</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>态度</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>和</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>良好氛围</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>，同时</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>直言顶着名师的光环也倍感</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>压力，</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>并表示</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>骄人</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>的</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>成绩已</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>属于过去</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>，</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>来</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>到一中后</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>还要</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>继续努力，坚持教学科研</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>齐头并进，</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>为一中</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>发展贡献力量</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=p style="BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0pt auto 15pt; TEXT-INDENT: 27.75pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020091013594784.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020091013594784.jpg" width=1200 height=800> </A></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=p style="BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0pt auto 15pt; TEXT-INDENT: 27.75pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>在听取了名师们的感言之后，马成永代表市教育局党委向大家</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>提出三点期望。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
